    88	## 5. Analysis (fixed now)
    89	
    90	- **Intervals.** Per market: paired seed bootstrap (9,999 resamples, percentile, 95%), the same resampled seed indices for
    91	  every rule and family of that market, so contrasts across rules stay paired. Pooled: equal market weights; in each
    92	  replicate, seeds are resampled independently within each market and the pooled statistic is the mean of the six market
