   113	reported as such, separately from failures. A failure is not read as evidence for any particular cause (search error and
   114	mixed outcomes are possible). Only if the pooled-S expectation is met may the paper say: within the D2 family, at the
   115	fixed parameters and search budgets, most of the B3 - R3 gap under the prescribed searches disappears when the attacker
